    {
      "topic": "pcap alignment",
      "detail": "tcpdump stamps frames with CLOCK_REALTIME; the loop, observer and ptp4l use CLOCK_MONOTONIC. Each run's packet series is aligned with one anchor (BC downstream port's first Announce vs its ptp4l 'to MASTER' line). Validated on 36 independent anchors (rogue / rogue-BC / standby-BC / replacement-BC first Announce vs their own 'to MASTER' log line): median residual 0.1 ms, max |residual| 1.0 ms."
    },
